# goal 4 and fires `TeleOn`; Carrington's post-lever cine teleports him to `PositionInfo23`
# (945.8,393.8,-105) on the platform below the station floor. Walk back through `Porte12`
# (960,720,128) and around the station's north side to the boarding platform
# (waypoints from a collision-world BFS of the real walker; the direct line south is walled).
t=420.90 goto 950 740
