# item95: `ULevel::FindSpot` now adjusts the post-lever cine's `tp 23` `SetLocation` into a free
# spot, so Carrington reaches `PositionInfo23` (the platform), the cine passes `wait player 128`,
# fires `Event Wave01 Wave02` (tabActions[63]) and parks at `wait event RushFinalCine`
# (tabActions[71]). `GenNMI6`/`GenNMI7` spawn `BaseSoldier6`/`BaseSoldier7` at t=520.4. The route
# tracks `BaseSoldier7` at t=520.5 (head band, 0.90) and fires from t=520.6 every 0.1 s, killing it
# before its shotgun burst, so the player survives the wave. item102: `BaseSoldier6` spawns from
# `GenNMI7` on the station's upper level at (871,-590,462) and its attack-point network 222
# (`AttackPoint13` -> `AttackPoint12` -> `AttackPoint0` on the ground) sends it toward the ground,
# but the item101 ledge rule stops it at the roof edge (615,-926,462); it never reaches or sees
# the player, so its `RushFinal` event never fires and `CineTrigger1` (counter 2) never reaches
# zero. The route therefore tracks it and fires (measured: no line of sight, 0 damage); goal 5 and
# the Hual04c travel stay unreached. This is the pinned next blocker (see the report).
t=466.40 engage BaseSoldier7 3000 15 aim=0.9 period=0.1
t=466.50 goto 941 396
t=486.50 wait_travel
